SUMMARY:Front Porch Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Join Acacia's Front Porch Book Club! Meets every third 
 Wednesday of the month to discuss a member-chosen book. This month we will 
 discuss Mothers and Sons by Adam Haslett. Everyone is welcome to read the 
 book and join the conversation. \n\nDo you require an accommodation to 
 participate in a Phoenix Public Library program\, service\, or activity? 
 Call 602-262-4636\, TTY 711\, or submit your request in person or through 
 Ask Us at least 14 business days before the event. \n\n¿Necesita alguna 
 adaptación para participar en algún programa\, servicio o actividad de 
 Phoenix Public Library? Llame al 602-262-4636\, a la línea TTY al 711 o 
 presente una solicitud en persona o por medio de Ask Us por lo menos 14 
 días hábiles antes del evento.
LOCATION:Meeting Room\, Acacia Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Matt Rummele":MAILTO:matthew.rummele@phoenix.gov
CATEGORIES:Authors, Book Discussions & Literature
